an original codebase (not a fork or clone of any existing product). It combines device inventory and remote management, patch and vulnerability management, security configuration and zero-trust posture assessment, data-loss-prevention and privacy-complian
\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 ce scanning, and passive user-productivity insight into a single agent and a single administrative console, licensed on a per-module basis against a centrally hosted License Server.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 This document describes the platform's architecture and every module in\hich\af0\dbch\af31505\loch\f0 
 technical detail, at the level of Prisma data models, API surface, service logic, and agent-side mechanisms - intended for an engineering audience already familiar with the codebase or evaluating it for extension, integration, or deployment planning.

